      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>The code currently attempts to identify the mime type using javascript: <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/File/type\" title=\"smart-link\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/File/type</a> </p>\n\n<p>The problem is that only works based on file extension for well-known extensions, and will otherwise return an empty string. Our code is not defaulting an empty string to “application/octet-stream”.</p>",
     "created": "16/Jul/21 10:22 AM",
